llowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T01:40:36Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T01:40:36Z","body":"> It may be related to [#109642](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109642) which has some indications that it may be due to an Nvidia Driver issue. Rolling back the Driver a bit and retesting would also be helpful if that is indeed the case\n\nDownloaded (https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/drivers/details/242141/)\nUninstalled the rollback driver.\nUninstalled the current driver.\nVerified by seeing \"Microsoft Basic Display Adaptor\".\nInstalled 32.0.15.7270\nTested 32.0.15.7270 - 572.70.\n\n*This seems to have fixed the issue. I'll do more testing later.\nThanks for the help!\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3194844513/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3197719298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109704#issuecomment-3197719298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109704","id":3197719298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-mVMC","user":{"login":"NoviceAdder","id":209561027,"node_id":"U_kgDODH2lww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209561027?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder","html_url":"https://github.com/NoviceAdder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoviceAdder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T16:56:22Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T17:02:07Z","body":"Re-applying the newest driver brought back the issue.\nDowngrading the driver to 572.70 fixed the issue.\n* I'll assume this is a driver regression issue.\n\nA Windows Performance Analyzer Trace File (.etl) has been made on the issue.\nAnd a bug report has been sent to Nvidia.\n\nReferences for the future:\nhttps://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/3507/\nhttps://nvidia.custhelp.com/app/answers/detail/a_id/3141/~/how-to-provide-valuable-feedback-to-nvidia","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3197719298/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3198733516","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109704#issuecomment-3198733516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109704","id":3198733516,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-qMzM","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-18T23:43:42Z","updated_at":"2025-08-18T23:43:42Z","body":"Can you reproduce this after switching the rendering driver for `windows` to `d3d12` in the Project Settings, or changing the renderer in the top-right corner to Compatibility?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3198733516/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3198847420","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109704#issuecomment-3198847420","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109704","id":3198847420,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-qom8","user":{"login":"NoviceAdder","id":209561027,"node_id":"U_kgDODH2lww","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/209561027?v=4","gravatar_id":